        </article>

        <article class="ned-project-card">
          <div class="ned-project-topline">
            <div>
              <span class="ned-project-number">03</span>
              <h2>Burger Joint - Wayfinding Proposal</h2>
              <p>Wayfinding proposal deck with interactive review model.</p>
            </div>
            <span class="ned-project-pill">PDF + 3D</span>
          </div>

          <div class="ned-model-frame" data-ned-model-viewer>
            <div class="ned-model-label">Interactive 3D Review</div>
            <div class="ned-model-loading">Loading 3D Model</div>
            <model-viewer
